Night Street Racer — third-party asset credits
=============================================

HDRI night sky
--------------
`assets/city/night_sky.hdr` is an original minimal procedural panorama
(64x32 Radiance RGBE night sky: dark-blue gradient, horizon glow band,
sparse star pixels) generated by `tools/make_night_sky_hdr.py`. It is a
stand-in in the style of Poly Haven's CC0 night skies
(https://polyhaven.com/hdris/night), kept tiny (KBs) for repo size and
offline builds. No Poly Haven file is vendored; Poly Haven's CC0 night
HDRIs are credited here as the reference the stand-in emulates.
Poly Haven reference index: https://polyhaven.com/hdris (CC0).

City kit meshes (Kenney style)
------------------------------
`assets/city/building_tower.glb` and `assets/city/building_shop.glb`
are original minimal procedural CC0 stand-ins (boxes with emissive
window bands) generated by `tools/make_city_kit.py`. They are styled
after Kenney's CC0 city kits (https://kenney.nl/assets/category:3D)
(CC0) -- City Kit Roads, Commercial and Suburban -- which are credited
here as the design reference; no Kenney file is vendored.

Neon signs and street props (Kenney style)
------------------------------------------
`assets/city/streetlamp.glb`, `assets/city/neon_sign.glb` and
`assets/city/street_prop.glb` are original minimal procedural CC0
stand-ins (pole prisms and emissive sign/prop boxes) generated by
`tools/make_city_kit.py`. They are styled after Kenney's CC0 street
and neon props (https://kenney.nl/assets/category:3D) (CC0), credited
here as the design reference; no Kenney or itch.io file is vendored.

Route barriers (Kenney style)
-----------------------------
`assets/city/barrier.glb` is an original minimal procedural CC0
stand-in (footed plank with an emissive stripe) generated by
`tools/make_city_kit.py`, styled after CC0 road-barrier props in
Kenney's kits (https://kenney.nl/assets/category:3D) (CC0). The
night district also renders emissive barrier stripes as
`BarrierStripe` mesh children of its edge walls. No third-party
barrier file is vendored.
